{"id":"t3-imlak","tahap":"T3","nama":"Imlak (KAFA)","sk":"Imlak","ikon":"📝","warna":"#8E6C3A","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 3 (ikut e-buku Imlak Tahun 3)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.67","sumber":"Original notes and questions following the lessons of the owner's e-BOOK IMLAK Tahun 3 (JAIS); Arabic words from the book; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t3-imlak-1","nama":"Kata nama mufrad mudhakkar","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Mufrad mudhakkar}} ialah kata nama tunggal untuk lelaki atau benda yang dianggap lelaki."},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menulis"},{"j":"p","t":"Kata nama mufrad mudhakkar ditulis dengan huruf asal perkataan seperti yang dilafazkan, tanpa tambahan <span class=\"arab\">ة</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">بَيْتٌ</span> : rumah","<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ</span> : buku","<span class=\"arab\">قَلَمٌ</span> : pen","<span class=\"arab\">كُرْسِيٌّ</span> : kerusi","<span class=\"arab\">تِلْمِيذٌ</span> : murid","<span class=\"arab\">مَكْتَبٌ</span> : meja tulis","<span class=\"arab\">رَجُلٌ</span> : lelaki","<span class=\"arab\">مَسْجِدٌ</span> : masjid","<span class=\"arab\">إِمَامٌ</span> : imam","<span class=\"arab\">طَبِيبٌ</span> : doktor","<span class=\"arab\">مُعَلِّمٌ</span> : guru","<span class=\"arab\">بَابٌ</span> : pintu"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh ayat"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">ذَهَبَ زَيْدٌ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ</span> : Zaid pergi ke sekolah.","<span class=\"arab\">مُحَمَّدٌ يَكْتُبُ الدَّرْسَ بِقَلَمٍ</span> : Muhammad menulis pelajaran dengan pen."]}],"glosari":[["Mufrad","Tunggal atau satu."],["Mudhakkar","Lelaki."],["Imlak","Menulis apa yang didengar dengan ejaan yang betul."]]},{"id":"t3-imlak-2","nama":"Kata nama muthanna mudhakkar","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Muthanna mudhakkar}} ialah kata nama yang menunjukkan dua lelaki atau dua benda mudhakkar."},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menulis"},{"j":"p","t":"Ditambah huruf <span class=\"arab\">ا</span> dan <span class=\"arab\">ن</span> berbaris di bawah di akhir kata nama: <span class=\"arab\">انِ</span>. Huruf sebelum alif berbaris di atas."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">بَيْتٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">بَيْتَانِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">كِتَابَانِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">قَلَمٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">قَلَمَانِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">رَجُلٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">رَجُلَانِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">تِلْمِيذٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">تِلْمِيذَانِ</span>","<span class=\"arab\">بَابٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">بَابَانِ</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh ayat"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">يَمْشِي وَلَدَانِ إِلَى الدُّكَّانِ</span> : Dua budak lelaki berjalan ke kedai.","<span class=\"arab\">لِكُلِّ إِنْسَانٍ أُذُنَانِ وَعَيْنَانِ</span> : Setiap manusia ada dua telinga dan dua mata."]}],"glosari":[["Muthanna","Dua."],["Tambahan","Huruf yang ditambah di akhir perkataan."]]},{"id":"t3-imlak-3","nama":"Kata nama mufrad muannath","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Mufrad muannath}} ialah kata nama tunggal untuk perempuan atau benda yang dianggap perempuan."},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menulis"},{"j":"p","t":"Ditambah huruf <span class=\"arab\">ة</span> (ta marbutah) di akhir kata nama. Huruf sebelum <span class=\"arab\">ة</span> berbaris di atas."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">مُسْلِمَةٌ</span> : orang Islam perempuan","<span class=\"arab\">مُعَلِّمَةٌ</span> : guru perempuan","<span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَةٌ</span> : sekolah","<span class=\"arab\">شَجَرَةٌ</span> : pokok","<span class=\"arab\">وَرْدَةٌ</span> : bunga mawar","<span class=\"arab\">بَقَرَةٌ</span> : lembu","<span class=\"arab\">مِسْطَرَةٌ</span> : pembaris","<span class=\"arab\">سَبُّورَةٌ</span> : papan hitam","<span class=\"arab\">نَظِيفَةٌ</span> : bersih","<span class=\"arab\">حَدِيقَةٌ</span> : taman"]},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh ayat"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">خَرَجَتْ تِلْمِيذَةٌ مِنَ ال